[{"text": "And I'll give the floor", "start": 5.72, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "to His Excellency Robert", "start": 8.2, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Komlan Edo Dussey,", "start": 11.12, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Minister of Foreign Affairs, Regional", "start": 15.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Integration, and Togolese Abroad of", "start": 17.36, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Togo.", "start": 20.48, "duration": 2.52}, {"text": ">> Excellence", "start": 37.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": ">> Your Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 38.28, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "heads of state and government,", "start": 41.08, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "President of the General Assembly,", "start": 44.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Secretary General,", "start": 46.8, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, heads of", "start": 49.36, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "delegations,", "start": 51.48, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 53.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "on behalf of the President of the", "start": 56.08, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Council, His Excellency Faure Essozimna", "start": 58.04, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "Gnassingb\u00e9,", "start": 61.16, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "of the government and the Togolese", "start": 62.4, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "people, I would like, Mr. President, to", "start": 64.36, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "convey to you my sincere", "start": 68.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and warm congratulations", "start": 71.8, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "on your election to the presidency of", "start": 73.92, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "this session of the General Assembly.", "start": 77.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "To you, Secretary General, sir, and Mr.", "start": 81.92, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Ant\u00f3nio Guterres,", "start": 84.8, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "I would like to convey Togo's sincere", "start": 86.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "gratitude for your unfailing commitment", "start": 88.84, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "to peace, to security,", "start": 92.44, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "to solidarity,", "start": 95.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and to sustainable development.", "start": 97.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "At a time when you are", "start": 101.04, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "completing your term, Togo would like to", "start": 104.72, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "pay a particular tribute to you", "start": 107.4, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "for these years of commitment, of", "start": 109.64, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "courage,", "start": 112.16, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "of listening, and of service", "start": 113.52, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "for", "start": 116.76, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "the defense of ideals of the United", "start": 118.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Nations and to reform our organization.", "start": 119.8, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "We would like to express the desire that", "start": 124.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the legacy of your action will continue", "start": 126.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "to inspire our organization", "start": 129.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and to guide those people who will have", "start": 131.88, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "the responsibility to continue your", "start": 135.08, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "work.", "start": 137.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "We wish you every success in the future", "start": 138.68, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "for your future commitments.", "start": 141.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, the topic of this section", "start": 146.2, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "asked us to do two things, to be clear", "start": 150.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "in our diagnosis and to be strong in our", "start": 153.6, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "commitment. To be clear because", "start": 156.4, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "we can no longer", "start": 160.04, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "have insufficient responses to those", "start": 162.6, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "challenges", "start": 165.52, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "that affect our international system.", "start": 167.08, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "Commitment because noting the limits of", "start": 170.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 174.0, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "should no longer mean that we renounce", "start": 175.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 178.68, "duration": 2.96}, {"text": "We", "start": 180.519, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "need even more multilateralism", "start": 181.64, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "and even more UN.", "start": 185.2, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "A stronger UN in defending its", "start": 188.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "principles, more effective in preventing", "start": 191.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and peacefully settling", "start": 195.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "disputes, more representative", "start": 197.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "in its decision-making structures", "start": 200.48, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "and closer to the realities of the", "start": 203.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "people.", "start": 205.519, "duration": 2.601}, {"text": "The world needs a UN that strengthens", "start": 209.08, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and reestablishes trust.", "start": 212.48, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "A UN that listens without turning away", "start": 214.76, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "from the concerns of those people that", "start": 218.44, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "it serves.", "start": 221.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Who decide without losing sight of those", "start": 223.84, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "for whom it", "start": 228.72, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "works and which promises without", "start": 231.2, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "forgetting", "start": 234.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "that it needs to keep its promises.", "start": 236.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "International trust cannot be restored", "start": 238.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "just through speeches.", "start": 241.68, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "It is established through the respect of", "start": 243.96, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "shared rules and here we're talking", "start": 247.16, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "about international law.", "start": 249.48, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Unfortunately,", "start": 251.92, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "we are seeing a worsening of", "start": 254.0, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "geopolitical tensions and a worrisome", "start": 255.8, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "return to war", "start": 258.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "at the heart of international relations.", "start": 260.88, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "Violations of international law and of", "start": 264.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the United Nations Charter are", "start": 266.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "increasing in number.", "start": 268.44, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "And the weakness of our responses", "start": 270.919, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "are akin to a type of tolerance that we", "start": 274.48, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "seem to be willing to accept.", "start": 278.28, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "Given this situation,", "start": 281.919, "duration": 5.481}, {"text": "Togo would like to reaffirm its firm", "start": 284.24, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "belief", "start": 287.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international law is not an obstacle to", "start": 288.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "power.", "start": 291.96, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "It guarantees its legitimacy,", "start": 293.32, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "its predictability, and its stability.", "start": 296.32, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "It protects the most vulnerable states", "start": 300.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and also serves the lasting interest of", "start": 304.2, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "the most powerful", "start": 307.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "by preventing uncontrolled clashes,", "start": 309.52, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "by shoring up exchanges, and by", "start": 312.88, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "establishing trust.", "start": 316.4, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Togo thus defends a pragmatic type of", "start": 319.8, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 323.84, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "that transforms commitments into", "start": 325.68, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "results,", "start": 327.919, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "that scaffolds power dynamics with", "start": 329.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "shared rules,", "start": 333.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and organizes the peaceful coexistence", "start": 334.88, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "of interests.", "start": 338.0, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 340.04, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Togo supports efforts", "start": 341.919, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "as part of the UN AT initiative to", "start": 345.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "improve the effectiveness,", "start": 349.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "the coherence, and the accountability", "start": 351.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "of our organization.", "start": 355.08, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 358.28, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "economic and climate vulnerabilities", "start": 361.44, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "are having an impact on stability and", "start": 365.28, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "security.", "start": 369.88, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "In Africa,", "start": 371.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "these are coupled with", "start": 373.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "ongoing security", "start": 376.12, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "challenges and can fuel tensions and", "start": 378.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "conflict.", "start": 381.68, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "This is why development questions,", "start": 383.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "questions of peace and security", "start": 386.12, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "must be tackled in a complementary", "start": 389.24, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "and", "start": 395.0, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "interlinked fashion.", "start": 397.32, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Lasting security cannot be boiled down", "start": 399.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "just to its military dimension. It", "start": 402.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "requires us to act on factors causing", "start": 405.52, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "vulnerability and it requires us to", "start": 409.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "promote dialogue, prevention, and", "start": 411.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "mediation.", "start": 415.2, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "Along these lines, the President of the", "start": 418.2, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "Council, His Excellency Faure Essozimna", "start": 420.56, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "Gnassingb\u00e9,", "start": 424.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "has striven to promote dialogue,", "start": 425.96, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "to bring people's positions closer, and", "start": 428.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to contribute to find political", "start": 432.4, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "solutions to crises that affect regions.", "start": 434.8, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "In West Africa and in the Sahel, for", "start": 440.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "example, our country is working hard to", "start": 442.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "encourage exchanges and to contribute to", "start": 446.76, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "the emergence of lasting political", "start": 449.32, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "responses.", "start": 451.919, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "In the Great Lakes region, Togo,", "start": 453.52, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "as part of African mediation,", "start": 457.12, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "is also making its contribution to", "start": 460.32, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "de-escalation,", "start": 463.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "to restoring trust,", "start": 465.72, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "and to the quest for lasting responses", "start": 468.52, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "to disputes.", "start": 472.64, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "These initiatives reflect a conviction.", "start": 476.48, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "In the face of crises, we need to", "start": 481.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "maintain spaces for dialogue. We need to", "start": 484.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "foster political and diplomatic means.", "start": 486.4, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Mediation is not a weakness.", "start": 490.56, "duration": 8.2}, {"text": "It is an expression of responsibility.", "start": 493.76, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Togo has made dialogue and preventive", "start": 499.12, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "diplomacy", "start": 501.8, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "the pillars of its foreign policy.", "start": 503.72, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "In our West African subregion", "start": 508.08, "duration": 5.639}, {"text": "and at the African level,", "start": 511.6, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "Togo", "start": 513.719, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "is working unfailingly to promote", "start": 515.0, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "mediation, stability, and the peaceful", "start": 518.039, "duration": 6.281}, {"text": "settlement of disputes.", "start": 521.039, "duration": 5.241}, {"text": "We're convinced", "start": 524.32, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "that no lasting solution", "start": 526.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "can be imposed from the outside", "start": 529.08, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "without actively listening to", "start": 532.36, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "local and sovereign realities and what's", "start": 536.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "going on on the ground.", "start": 539.04, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "Africa is not asking for others to act", "start": 541.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "in its place. It is asking for its", "start": 545.08, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "efforts to be recognized, assisted, and", "start": 547.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "supported.", "start": 550.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 553.12, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "on the 26th of September 2025,", "start": 555.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "almost to the day a year ago,", "start": 561.04, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "right here,", "start": 565.839, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "before this august assembly,", "start": 568.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "I challenged", "start": 570.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "the universal conscience on", "start": 573.32, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "the distortion of the map of the world", "start": 576.12, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "which wrongly shrunk the size of Africa", "start": 579.68, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "on the map of the world and [snorts]", "start": 583.56, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "in the global collective imagination.", "start": 586.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Just a few days ago on the 4th of", "start": 590.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "September 2026 to be precise", "start": 593.56, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "in this very hall", "start": 597.2, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Togo's call was heard", "start": 601.36, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and a reform of the map of the world was", "start": 604.72, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "adopted.", "start": 609.36, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "The international community", "start": 610.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "made history", "start": 613.64, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "by adopting", "start": 616.68, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "with a very", "start": 618.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "large majority of 164 votes by adopting", "start": 620.88, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "resolution", "start": 624.64, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "called correct the map.", "start": 626.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Togo is delighted that this resolution", "start": 633.0, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "was adopted. This decision", "start": 637.48, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "has a simple requirement is it?", "start": 641.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "They need to represent the world based", "start": 644.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "on scientific truth", "start": 647.08, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "and respecting the equal dignity of", "start": 649.48, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "the people.", "start": 654.88, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Correcting the map is not just", "start": 656.56, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "rectifying a geographical distortion.", "start": 659.64, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "It's also correcting the perceptions", "start": 663.6, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "that come with in particular in", "start": 667.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "education", "start": 669.8, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "in information and in public action.", "start": 671.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Correcting", "start": 676.28, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "the map of the world on behalf of", "start": 678.64, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "scientific truth", "start": 682.96, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "on behalf of responsibility", "start": 684.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "in the face of history on behalf of", "start": 688.2, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "justice and equity", "start": 690.04, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "on behalf of repairing", "start": 692.48, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "cartographic map distortions that were", "start": 697.36, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "inherited from the past in English.", "start": 699.32, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": ">> Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 701.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the adoption of this resolution", "start": 704.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "is not the end", "start": 707.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of our journey.", "start": 710.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "The adoption of this resolution", "start": 712.76, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "is now the beginning of our resolution.", "start": 716.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "For us", "start": 720.6, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "as African,", "start": 722.08, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "the adoption of this resolution", "start": 724.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "is far more than a cartographic", "start": 727.16, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "decision.", "start": 729.68, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "The adoption of this", "start": 731.52, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "this resolution", "start": 733.48, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "is an act of recognition.", "start": 735.16, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "The adoption of this resolution", "start": 738.52, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "is an act of reparation.", "start": 741.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "The adoption of this resolution", "start": 744.64, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "it's an act of justice.", "start": 747.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "The adoption was of this resolution it", "start": 751.0, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "for justice in the world.", "start": 754.48, "duration": 4.359}, {"text": "That way, today,", "start": 756.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "we have not redrawn the world.", "start": 758.839, "duration": 5.881}, {"text": "We have corrected", "start": 762.48, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "the way in which the world", "start": 764.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "is represented.", "start": 767.48, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Togo intends", "start": 770.4, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "to build on this historic momentum.", "start": 772.24, "duration": 8.599}, {"text": "We count on the continued mobilization", "start": 777.2, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "of member states", "start": 780.839, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "of the United Nation", "start": 783.08, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "and its agencies,", "start": 785.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of regional organization, of scientific", "start": 787.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "institution institution, and of", "start": 790.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "technologies platforms", "start": 793.36, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "to translate this resolution into", "start": 795.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "concrete action.", "start": 798.76, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Because", "start": 801.8, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "a resolution must not remain a text.", "start": 803.76, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "Resolution must become action.", "start": 807.6, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Action must become knowledge.", "start": 811.56, "duration": 8.2}, {"text": "Knowledge must become education. And", "start": 815.68, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "education must become understanding", "start": 819.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "among peoples.", "start": 823.6, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "As we say,", "start": 825.92, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "a federal map does not redraw", "start": 827.52, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "the border of the world.", "start": 831.16, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "It transforms the way we see the world", "start": 833.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "ourself.", "start": 837.96, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Togo, now, wishes to move from", "start": 840.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "resolution to action.", "start": 842.84, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "We propose the opening of a new phase", "start": 845.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "of international cooperation", "start": 850.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "bringing together the member state,", "start": 852.76, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "the agency of United Nation, we say", "start": 855.8, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "scientific and academic institution,", "start": 858.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "geographer and cartographers, historian,", "start": 861.6, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "educator,", "start": 864.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "young people, and the innovators shaping", "start": 865.72, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "the technologies of tomorrow, including", "start": 869.56, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 873.4, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "Our objective is clear, dear friends,", "start": 875.92, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "to make cartography an even more", "start": 879.6, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "powerful instrument of knowledge,", "start": 882.96, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "education, inclusion, and mutual", "start": 886.2, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "understanding amongst people.", "start": 889.96, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "We must encourage research.", "start": 893.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "We must develop also a new education", "start": 896.08, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "tools for our generation.", "start": 899.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 902.52, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "the digital revolution give", "start": 904.04, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "give us give us the issue and in turn in", "start": 906.4, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "in turn a new dimension.", "start": 910.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Billion of people now consult map", "start": 913.28, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "everyday on their phones, their", "start": 917.36, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "computers, and digital platform.", "start": 919.4, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Children, for example, discover the", "start": 922.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "world through the digital maps.", "start": 925.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "The businessmen make decision using", "start": 927.72, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "cartographic uh data.", "start": 931.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "The government also rely on special", "start": 934.76, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "information.", "start": 937.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "And artificial intelligence system", "start": 938.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "increasingly interpret our planet", "start": 941.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "through digital data and a cartographic", "start": 944.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "representation. The question", "start": 948.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "before us", "start": 951.56, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "therefore is no longer only about a", "start": 953.12, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "printed maps.", "start": 956.4, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "It's about the digital image", "start": 958.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of our planet", "start": 961.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "that we are transmitting", "start": 963.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "to the generation of tomorrow.", "start": 966.12, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 969.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "we also want to correct the map", "start": 971.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "to become a dialogue", "start": 974.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "between uh generations.", "start": 976.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We want young people", "start": 979.16, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "to have the opportunity to look at our", "start": 981.2, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "planet with a fresh eyes.", "start": 984.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "We want schools, universities, and", "start": 988.96, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "research institution", "start": 991.76, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "to become places where the", "start": 993.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "representation of our world", "start": 996.52, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "have", "start": 999.2, "duration": 1.96}, {"text": "uh", "start": 1000.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "can be for can be studied, questioned,", "start": 1001.16, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "and understood. We want African", "start": 1004.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "cartographers to contribute. We want", "start": 1007.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "European cartographers to contribute. We", "start": 1010.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "want Asian cartographer to contribute.", "start": 1013.04, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "We want cartographers from America, from", "start": 1015.88, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Arab", "start": 1018.36, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Arab region, Pacific, and every region", "start": 1019.52, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "in the world", "start": 1022.56, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "to play to to contribute because the", "start": 1024.12, "duration": 4.839}, {"text": "world belongs", "start": 1026.72, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "to all of us.", "start": 1028.959, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "And because the way we represent our", "start": 1031.48, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "world", "start": 1034.76, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "should be a conversation open to all.", "start": 1035.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 1040.439, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "today", "start": 1042.12, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Togo launches an appeal", "start": 1043.319, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "an appeal to all member states", "start": 1046.64, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "an appeal to international organization", "start": 1049.56, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "an appeal to the scientific community an", "start": 1052.68, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "appeal to educator an appeal to", "start": 1055.84, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "innovators an appeal to the young people", "start": 1058.48, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "of the world.", "start": 1061.88, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Let us make correct the map", "start": 1063.16, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "an international laboratory for", "start": 1067.12, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "reflection", "start": 1069.44, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "refresh and innovation on the", "start": 1070.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "representation of our world.", "start": 1073.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Let us transform", "start": 1076.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "real this resolution into a program of", "start": 1078.76, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "cooperation. Let us transform an idea", "start": 1082.8, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "into into knowledge", "start": 1086.52, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "knowledge. Let us transform knowledge", "start": 1088.76, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "into education and let us transform", "start": 1091.92, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "education into greater understanding", "start": 1094.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "among the people we say.", "start": 1097.56, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "We know now what we have to do for our", "start": 1100.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "our generation. We are not here simply", "start": 1103.68, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to correct a map. We are here to to help", "start": 1106.56, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "correct a way of see of seeing a way of", "start": 1110.8, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "seeing somethings irritate from the past", "start": 1115.36, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "a way of seeing that can be enriched by", "start": 1119.08, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "science a way of seeing that can be", "start": 1122.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "rebalances by", "start": 1125.32, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "our", "start": 1127.48, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "our knowledge. And ultimately a way of", "start": 1128.36, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "seeing that reminds us of one simple", "start": 1131.8, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "truth.", "start": 1135.8, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "We share our planet. We share our", "start": 1136.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 1140.08, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "And we must learn", "start": 1141.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to see our common world with greater", "start": 1143.84, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "accuracy, greater justice, and greater", "start": 1147.04, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "understanding.", "start": 1151.04, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Let us correct the map. Let us broaden", "start": 1152.36, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "our perspective. Let us strengthen our", "start": 1155.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "understanding.", "start": 1159.4, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "Excellence", "start": 1161.0, "duration": 2.64}, {"text": "Let", "start": 1162.48, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": ">> Excellencies,", "start": 1163.64, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "the fact that a resolution called", "start": 1165.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Correct the Map was adopted here on the", "start": 1169.92, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "4th of September 2026 will go down in", "start": 1173.04, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "the history books.", "start": 1175.8, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "And we would like the history books to", "start": 1179.64, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "remember another thing.", "start": 1181.24, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "That thanks to this resolution, the", "start": 1183.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "United Nations began", "start": 1184.52, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "a global dialogue", "start": 1187.32, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "on the way humanity represents itself.", "start": 1189.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Togo stands ready", "start": 1192.96, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "to continue this dialogue. And finally,", "start": 1194.76, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "we invite all member states to join us.", "start": 1197.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "We invite scientists to guide us.", "start": 1200.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "We invite educators to support us.", "start": 1203.0, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "We invite youth to hold us to account.", "start": 1206.24, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "And we invite innovators to help us to", "start": 1210.08, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "build the tools of the future.", "start": 1212.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Correct the Map is not the end of the", "start": 1217.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "map. Correct the Map is the beginning of", "start": 1219.24, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "a new way of seeing the world.", "start": 1222.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Thank you for your kind attention.", "start": 1226.72, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": ">> I thank the Minister of Foreign Affairs,", "start": 1237.36, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Regional Integration and Togolese Abroad", "start": 1240.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of Togo.", "start": 1243.24, "duration": 2.8}]